      "body": "Put the flour, sugar, yeast, water and salt in the mixer bowl. Mix, then knead with the hook until smooth and elastic, ≈10 min. The dough will be stiff."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "Cover the bowl. Let the dough rise until roughly doubled, ≈1 h."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "Preheat oven to <span class=\"rc-nw\">425 °F <span class=\"rc-muted\">(218 °C)</span></span>. Line the sheet pan with parchment. Bring a wide pot of water to a boil."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "Divide the dough into 8 pieces (≈105 g each). Roll each into a tight ball."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "Poke a hole through the center of each ball and stretch it to ≈2 in across."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "Boil the bagels in the pot, a few at a time, 1–2 min, flipping halfway. Lift them out and drain."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "Bake on the lined sheet until deep golden, ≈20 min."
    }
